{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/pwsh -Command \"pwsh.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command '\"'$env:MCP_WORKSPACE_PATH=\"/home/sharpninja/github/McpServer\"; $w=\"/home/sharpninja/.codex/plugins/cache/mcpserver-codex-plugin/mcpserver/1.118.0/Invoke-CodexMcpPlugin.ps1\"; & $w -Command Invoke -Method workflow.requirements.getTr -ParamsObject @{id=\"TR-MCP-NUKE-009\"} -CacheRoot \"/home/sharpninja/github/McpServer/.claude/worktrees/session-20261009/.mcpServer/codex\"'\"' \"","aggregated_output":"type: result\npayload:\n  requestId: req-20261010T225721Z-e3ec\n  result:\n    id: TR-MCP-NUKE-009\n    title: Build infrastructure tests bound every child process and its redirected output\n    description: Every child process that the Build.Tests infrastructure suite starts with redirected standard output and standard error SHALL run through one shared helper that bounds the wait for the child to exit, bounds the wait for its redirected output to close after it exits, drains both streams concurrently, kills the child's process tree when the exit timeout expires or the caller cancels, and starts dotnet children with --disable-build-servers, so that no child, descendant, or persistent build server can stall the suite.\n    status: pending\n    priority: high\n    area: MCP\n    subarea: NUKE\n    notes: \"Implementation detail of FR-MCP-BUILD-001 \\\"Tooling for repeatable builds\\\" (operator, 2026-10-10: \\\"Now, the TR are implementation detail of the FR.\\\"); Build.Tests is build infrastructure (operator, 2026-10-10: \\\"Build.Tests is infrastructure, not application and should not be treated as unit tests.\\\"). Introduced for BUG-BUILD-007 (triage-report-c381e4c99d284e0dbc1ec443c221ca59). Root cause observed live on 2026-10-10 at 22:14Z (Linux, SDK 10.0.201) during the BUG-BUILD-006 trim-inventory run: the Build.Tests process (PID 2575389, 0 s CPU over 850 s, no child processes) was blocked on EOF of a dotnet child that had already exited; the other ends of both redirected pipes (pipe:[16191191] stdout, pipe:[16191192] stderr) were held as fd 1 and fd 2 by an MSBuild worker node (MSBuild.dll /nodemode:1 /nodeReuse:true, PID 2575659) that the child's build had spawned and that had been reparented to the user systemd (PPID 1082); the node also held the test process's stdin. Node reuse keeps such a node alive after the build, so EOF never arrives; when an idle reusable node already exists the build connects to it instead and nothing inherits the pipes, which explains the earlier passing run. TrimAnalysisWarningInventoryTests bounds only WaitForExitAsync (20 minutes); the await of its output tasks that follows is unbounded. Receipt: bug-build-007-evidence.log.txt.\"\n    acceptanceCriteria:\n    - id: AC-001\n      text: When the child exits while a descendant still holds its redirected output open, the helper fails within the drain period, naming the command and stating that the captured output may be incomplete, instead of waiting for the descendant.\n      isSatisfied: false\n      evidence: tests/Build.Tests/BoundedProcessTests.cs\n    - id: AC-002\n      text: When the child runs past its exit timeout, the helper kills the child's process tree and fails with a timeout naming the command.\n      isSatisfied: false\n      evidence: tests/Build.Tests/BoundedProcessTests.cs\n    - id: AC-003\n      text: When the caller cancels, the helper kills the child's process tree and stops waiting.\n      isSatisfied: false\n      evidence: tests/Build.Tests/BoundedProcessTests.cs\n    - id: AC-004\n      text: The helper drains standard output and standard error concurrently, so a child that fills one pipe's buffer before writing to the other completes.\n      isSatisfied: false\n      evidence: tests/Build.Tests/BoundedProcessTests.cs\n    - id: AC-005\n      text: dotnet children started by Build.Tests pass --disable-build-servers.\n      isSatisfied: false\n      evidence: tests/Build.Tests/BoundedProcessTests.cs\n    - id: AC-006\n      text: No Build.Tests source other than the helper reads a child's redirected output or waits for a child to exit.\n      isSatisfied: false\n      evidence: tests/Build.Tests/BoundedProcessTests.cs\n    scopeStartLayerKey: layer-1\n    createdAt: 2026-10-10T22:57:22.5720073+00:00\n    updatedAt: 2026-10-10T22:57:22.5721288+00:00\n  deprecated: true\n\n---\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
