{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/pwsh -Command \"pwsh.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command 'foreach(\"'$id in @(\"BUG-BUILD-002\",\"BUG-BUILD-003\",\"BUG-BUILD-004\",\"BUG-BUILD-005\",\"BUG-BUILD-006\",\"BUG-BUILD-008\",\"BUG-BUILD-009\")){\"=== $id ===\"; Get-Content \"/tmp/hv-build-store/$id.yaml\" | Select-Object -Skip 4 -First 34}; Get-ChildItem /tmp/hv-build-store -Filter \"BUG-BASELINE-*.yaml\" | ForEach-Object { $t=Get-Content -Raw $_.FullName; \"{0}: {1}, triage={2}\" -f $_.BaseName,([regex]::Match($t,\"(?m)''^    title: (.+)$\").Groups[1].Value),([regex]::Match($t,\"triage-report-[0-9a-f]{32}\").Value)}'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"=== BUG-BUILD-002 ===\n    id: BUG-BUILD-002\n    title: Restore every project the Nuke Compile target builds\n    section: Build\n    priority: high\n    done: false\n    description:\n    - Build.Compile builds every *.csproj under src/ and tests/ (except Build.Tests) with --no-restore, but Build.Restore restores only QBrainAi.sln; src/Compatibility/SharpNinja.McpServer.Client is outside the solution, so Compile fails with NETSDK1004 and ./build.ps1 Test (G2) cannot run.\n    - PLAN-SESSIONTURNREVIEW-001 P0.1 requires this pre-existing failure fixed under its own TODO before A1 starts.\n    - 'Fix by Byrd v4: a RED Build.Tests case that every project Compile builds is restored by Restore (or is in the solution), then the fix, then green and ./build.ps1 Compile and Test, then a Codex gpt-6-sol xhigh HV before done.'\n    technicalDetails: &o0 []\n    implementationTasks:\n    - task: 'RED: Build.Tests BuildProjectSetTests (both cases) fail on assertions against an empty GetBuildProjectFiles stub (recorded: Failed 2, Passed 0, Skipped 0)'\n      done: true\n    - task: 'Fix: Restore and Compile share GetBuildProjectFiles; Restore adds the projects the solution does not list; BuildTargetTests.cs:431-432 updated after its recorded RED; TR-MCP-NUKE-002 AC-002/AC-003 cited (c0f82356)'\n      done: true\n    - task: 'Gates: targeted cases green (Passed 4, Skipped 0); ./build.ps1 Test runs: Restore restores the solution plus the seven Compatibility projects, Compile builds all 53 projects; the Test target then reports pre-existing unit failures (filed separately)'\n      done: true\n    - task: 'Infrastructure gate: full Build.Tests (dotnet test tests/Build.Tests/Build.Tests.csproj -c Debug) at zero failures and zero skips, after BUG-BUILD-003..007 (Build.Tests is infrastructure, not unit tests; operator ruling 2026-10-10)'\n      done: false\n    - task: Codex gpt-6-sol xhigh HV pass before done (one batched HV for BUG-BUILD-001..007)\n      done: false\n    dependsOn:\n    - BUG-BUILD-001\n    functionalRequirements: *o0\n    technicalRequirements: *o0\n  deprecated: true\n\n---\n\n=== BUG-BUILD-003 ===\n    id: BUG-BUILD-003\n    title: Resolve sibling plugin repos from a .claude/worktrees checkout\n    section: Build\n    priority: high\n    done: false\n    description:\n    - 'SyncAgentPluginsChecksumTests.SyncAgentPlugins_OfficialPluginLibChecksumsMatchCanonicalCore and DocsSyncG8OverlayTests.G8_SyncAgentPlugins_OfficialPluginLibChecksumsMatchCanonicalCore fail with \"plugin root missing\" for every plugin repo (codex, claude-code, copilot, cline, grok) when run from /home/sharpninja/github/McpServer/.claude/worktrees/session-20261009: the default plugin-parent resolution (Build.ResolveOfficialPluginSiblingParent) walks up from .worktrees or .mcpServer/worktrees, not .claude/worktrees, so the sibling repos under /home/sharpninja/github are not found.'\n    - 'Triage: triage-report-75290be6d6b749119a7819fba3cca386.'\n    - 'Found 2026-10-10 by the full Build.Tests run (dotnet test tests/Build.Tests/Build.Tests.csproj -c Debug: Failed 5, Passed 347, Skipped 0, Total 352) in worktree .claude/worktrees/session-20261009 at a90e8b4c, Linux, SDK 10.0.201.'\n    - 'Classification: Build.Tests is the build-infrastructure suite, not app